<h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset the password associated with your account. If you made this request, please click the
    button below to recover your account securely.</p>

<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center">
            <span class="highlight">
                <%= resetToken %>
            </span>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">This token will expire in 10 minutes. <b>If you did not request a password
        reset, please ignore this email.</b></p>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Best regards,<br>The Placement Cell Team</p>